# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build.
#
# Without this file gcloud generates a default that only skips .git, so any
# local virtualenv or scratch file sitting in the working copy gets uploaded
# and then baked into the image by `COPY . .`.
#
# Note: gcloud does NOT read .dockerignore, so the two lists are kept in sync
# by hand.
.git
.gitignore
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

*.log
*.zip
*.tar.gz
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Not code the service runs: notes, validation fixtures, stray diffs (they
# describe removed endpoints and internals; 2026-11 audit L3). scripts/ stays:
# check_startup.py is written to run inside the image.
maindiff.txt
eline*
docs/
validation/
*.md
